flowchart TD
    A[Client sends multipart image] --> B[ASP.NET Core binds IFormFile]
    B --> C[ImageFileValidator validates metadata and signature]

    C --> D{Validation successful?}
    D -- No --> E[Return 400 ProblemDetails]
    D -- Yes --> F[Obtain detected image format]

    F --> G[Generate new GUID]
    G --> H[Map detected format to canonical extension]
    H --> I[Build generated stored filename]
    I --> J[Create storage directory if needed]

    J --> K[Open destination with FileMode.CreateNew]
    K --> L[Copy uploaded bytes asynchronously]

    L --> M{Copy successful?}
    M -- No --> N[Dispose output stream]
    N --> O[Delete partially written file]
    O --> P[Return generic 500 ProblemDetails]

    M -- Yes --> Q[Return storage metadata]
    Q --> R[200 OK]

    subgraph Security boundary
        S[Original client filename]
        T[Sanitize for display only]
        U[Never use it in destination path]
        S --> T
        T --> U
    end